d normal thickening with no internal echoes seen, measured 0.4 cm.</p><p><strong><u>LEFT OVARY</u></strong>: It can be located at its normal anatomical position, which contained double anechoic lesion, measured Cyst I-2.2 x 2.2 cm, Cyst II 2.1 cm x 1.8 cm with no solid component seen.</p><p><br></p><p>There is evidence of mild free fluid observed in the pouch of Douglas</p><p><strong><u>ENDOMETRIUM</u></strong>: Stripe is of uniform and thickness measured 0.9 cm with mild fluid collection observed.</p><p><strong><u>SUMMARY: ULTRASOUND FEATURES HIGHLY SUGGESTIVE OF: 1. MULTIPLE FOLLICULAR CYST (LEFT). 2. PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE (MILD). 3? ENDOMETRITIS</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p>SONOGRAPHER: GODWIN (0243652119)</p>',NULL)","sqlMessage":"Column 'sonographer' cannot be null","sqlState":"23000"}
